  "label": "The slogan 'make america great again!!!' is mapped onto Donald Trump as the embodiment of the campaign's message.",
  "description": "The text 'make america great again!!!' is overlaid on the image of Donald Trump, who is depicted in a commanding pose. This creates an analogical mapping where the slogan is not merely text but is projected onto Trump as the personification of the slogan's promise and political agenda. The visual of Trump pointing assertively reinforces the slogan's implied call to action and leadership, mapping the abstract political message onto a specific individual who is visually associated with its delivery.",
